  "description": "As a family bike the Fr8 is unparalleled. A universal frame, modular design, city front carrier, long rear carrier and integrated child saddle. It’s the sweetest riding family bicycle ever built. The quintessential daily do-it-all bike is also your family bicycle. The Fr8 child saddle is integrated into the front carrier mounting as if it were part of the bike itself. Kids love to be up front on the bike, they can see everything and it’s much easier to chat while riding. The child saddle is designed specifically for the Fr8 and because of the Fr8’s frame geometry and long wheelbase the adult still has ample room to pedal even with an 8 year old on the child saddle. Add a crate to the front carrier for all your shopping and gear or some panniers on the long rear carrier. It’s the perfect bicycle for taking the children to daycare or school before you head off to work, or for a fun day out with the family. The long rear carrier can come in handy later on for additional child seating.",
